                                                "sense_id": "c68bffa2-89e6-32d3-b046-519bc9f94368",
                                                "text": "Within a few weeks I was in the studio recording voiceovers. They're harder than they look, and the way that editors and producers create narratives from hundreds of hours of footage still amazes me."
